Cell["\<\
The type must be the map's. The first map {5, 5}, of twelve pentagons on a \
surface of genus 4, has the graph of the icosahedron; read as {3, 5}, the \
same graph gives the sphere.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"b1303dd7-fd22-446d-bada-5f0156215eda"],

